#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Scan and remove unused media files from your WordPress site to free "
"up disk space. Deep scans post content, ACF fields, WooCommerce, "
"Elementor, theme files, widgets, and more."
msgstr ""
"Scan en verwijder ongebruikte mediabestanden van je WordPress-site "
"om schijfruimte vrij te maken. Doorzoekt berichtinhoud, ACF-velden, "
"WooCommerce, Elementor, themabestanden, widgets en meer."

